nup (trigger)\nbegin/renew/finish_tabular_review_generation (lease generasi)\nclaim_db_job(s) · write_memory_file (CAS) · begin/release_memory_conversation_turn\nremove_org_member · request_account_deletion · soft_delete_organization · purge_expired_organizations\nget_*_overview (daftar proyek/workflow/chat/review) · find_document_text / read_document_text", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "create_upload_session · queue_upload_session_file_processing · claim_upload_processing_job\ncreate_document_version(s) · activate_/delete_document_version · queue_document_version_cleanup (trigger)\nbegin/renew/finish_tabular_review_generation (lease generasi)\nclaim_db_job(s) · write_memory_file (CAS) · begin/release_memory_conversation_turn\nremove_org_member · request_account_deletion · soft_delete_organization · purge_expired_organizations\nget_*_overview (daftar proyek/workflow/chat/review) · find_document_text / read_document_text", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "da723af61d404e688dab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1230, "width": 2280, "height": 129.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cc19eeedd050413b80cf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1502488933, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1538146088, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419174330, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "364c4934b2524ed4b6d1", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 1244, "width": 170.8, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cc19eeedd050413b80cf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1395947870, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 19526946, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419174330, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Siapa yang menulis", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Siapa yang menulis", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "efe7d2d5ca814d20892b", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 1275.8, "width": 727.3, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cc19eeedd050413b80cf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 207415748, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 958680007, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419174330, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Backend: supabase-js dengan SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY (service_role) → PostgREST :54321/rest/v1.\nGoTrue (supabase/gotrue) memiliki skema auth.* (auth.users, sesi, MFA, SSO).\ndb-init (service compose, one-shot) memuat schema.sql / menerapkan migrate.sh up lalu GRANT ke service_role.\nMigrasi baru: nama YYYYMMDD_NN_nama.sql + update schema.sql + daftar ledger; jangan edit yang sudah rilis.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Backend: supabase-js dengan SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY (service_role) → PostgREST :54321/rest/v1.\nGoTrue (supabase/gotrue) memiliki skema auth.* (auth.users, sesi, MFA, SSO).\ndb-init (service compose, one-shot) memuat schema.sql / menerapkan migrate.sh up lalu GRANT ke service_role.\nMigrasi baru: nama YYYYMMDD_NN_nama.sql + update schema.sql + daftar ledger; jangan edit yang sudah rilis.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "90e0b223d14f4d81a76a", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 1287.0, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "grou